{
  "id": "ag-exponents",
  "chapterNumber": "3",
  "title": {
    "en": "Exponents &amp; Polynomials",
    "ar": null
  },
  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Exponent rules and polynomial structure are the algebraic &ldquo;grammar&rdquo; that keeps longer manipulations clean and error-free.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Laws of exponents",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>\\( a^m a^n=a^{m+n} \\), \\(\\quad \\dfrac{a^m}{a^n}=a^{m-n} \\), \\(\\quad (a^m)^n=a^{mn} \\),</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0\">\\( a^0=1\\ (a\\neq 0) \\), \\(\\quad a^{-n}=\\dfrac{1}{a^n} \\), \\(\\quad a^{1/n}=\\sqrt[n]{a}. \\)</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "heading": "Special products &amp; factoring",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Square of a sum",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( (a+b)^2=a^2+2ab+b^2 \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Square of a difference",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( (a-b)^2=a^2-2ab+b^2 \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Difference of squares",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( a^2-b^2=(a-b)(a+b) \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 3.A — Simplify",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Simplify \\( \\dfrac{x^5 \\cdot x^2}{x^3} \\).</p><p>Add exponents on top, then subtract:</p>\\[ \\frac{x^{5+2}}{x^3}=x^{7-3}=x^4. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 3.B — Factor",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Factor \\( x^2-9 \\).</p><p>A difference of squares with \\( a=x,\\ b=3 \\):</p>\\[ x^2-9=(x-3)(x+3). \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
